# Generated import files

These files are **emit output**. A later `--clean` convert deletes them.

```text
❌ Edit B2B7816*Support.java to hardcode an email
✅ Overlay Properties.Email in CtxFields / converter identity pack, then reconvert
```

```text
❌ Change jsonExists to jsonAbsent in one imported test
✅ Fix Existence Match emit in ra_converter.py + add a contract test
```

Runtime-only bugs (token refresh, OTP pad, SQL gate) belong in helpers, not in `*Support.java`.
Replicate ReadyAPI (last `setPropertyValue` wins). Do not invent a different extract order in Support.
For a confused emit, use skill `readyapi-restassured-migration`.
